**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/TestResults/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
documentation/
*.md
Dockerfile
compose.yaml
.dockerignore

# The git-ignored local secrets compose reads: never sent to the builder, so no COPY can put them in an image.
# The committed .env.example holds no secrets and is not excluded.
.env

# Python: the local environment and caches are rebuilt inside the image
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# TypeScript incremental build info: rebuilt inside the image
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Next.js build output: rebuilt inside the image
**/.next/

# The Android shell is not part of the dashboard image. Keep keystores out of the build context.
src/dashboard/android/
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore

# The files a local run writes under the API (the feedback budget; saved layouts): never in an image
src/MarqSpec.FuturesLiquidityDashboard.Api/data/
